1afb|n|Any projection or division, especially one of a somewhat rounded form ; A rounded projection or division of a leaf. ; A membranous flap on the sides of the toes of certain birds, as the coot. ; A round projecting part of an organ, as of the liver, lungs, brain, etc. See Illust. of Brain. ; The projecting part of a cam wheel or of a non-circular gear wheel.	a:1i6i,216,3~1i6i,216,3
